<p>A gunman killed six people in Kyiv on Saturday, wounded at least 14 others, then barricaded himself inside a supermarket with hostages. Ukrainian special police units shot him dead after a standoff of about 40 minutes. Officials said the attack took place in the Holosiivskyi district of the Ukrainian capital, and President Volodymyr Zelensky said police rescued four hostages during the operation. Ukrainian authorities are treating the case as a terrorist act and are investigating the motive, including whether Russia may have directed the attack. Officials identified the suspect as a Moscow-born man, but publicly said they had not established a motive. Some outlets described the shooting as Ukraine’s deadliest mass shooting in years, a grim reminder that a country already living through war is now facing another form of violence in its capital.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/jtbDqjS8V-4kSeETxu-AJdHuvQ6HGSpVEwRwwuE_VUiKCguxn4xIeiymchvs5i_XgiVMGj07Uniigz1nh6XDrQCsNp2CTQh9S8ABxN0AJnnh9R7pDg6PV378-Lz1TX9t_GesstAGNYH9tuEYkN0cWgO-Ld40NAaDRajn4exZbGWVXR54bKqHsZk4rSndYnhh8YnMaGAhLA1dWMLqturIjt5BOiDFMy9QbaqfL_p8yqCSALsT5_yAE_lmLecokBn_6VhKjMS1jcedth3a7A' alt='A police officer stands in front of a bullet hole in the window of a Kyiv supermarket on Saturday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Casualty breakdown: Zelensky said four people were killed on the street, one hostage was killed inside the supermarket, and a sixth victim later died in hospital.</li><li>Child among the wounded: Sky News reported 15 people were injured, including a child, while most other outlets put the toll at at least 14.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Volodymyr Zelensky: The president said people hospitalized with injuries and trauma were getting the care they needed after the attack. (<a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/at-least-5-killed-by-gunman-in-kyiv-shooting/'>Politico</a>)</li><li>Ihor Klymenko: Ukraine’s interior minister said the gunman was killed while resisting arrest after police first tried to reach him through a negotiator. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3350599/kyiv-gunman-kills-5-and-takes-hostages-being-shot-dead-ukraine-police'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>Tetyana, supermarket employee: She described the confusion inside the store, saying people hid behind refrigerators after hearing repeated loud bursts and then realizing they were under attack. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1993009/at-least-6-killed-after-gunman-opens-fire-in-ukrainian-capital'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/18/terrorist-attack-kyiv-ukraine'>Investigators examine whether Ukraine terrorist attack was directed by Russia</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/several-people-killed-as-gunman-opens-fire-in-kyiv-says-mayor-11376755#publisher=newsstand'>6 Killed As Gunman Takes Hostages, Opens Fire In Supermarket In Kyiv</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/ukraine-shooting-incident-kyiv/33735226.html'>Six Killed In Daylight Shooting Incident In Kyiv, Ukrainian Officials Say</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-gunman-shot-dead-after-killing-spree-in-kyiv/a-76843205'>Ukraine: Gunman shot dead after killing spree in Kyiv</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-six-die-in-kyiv-shooting-police-kill-gunman-after-hostage-situation/'>Six die in Kyiv shooting, police kill gunman after hostage situation</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/18/world/europe/kyiv-ukraine-mass-shooting-hostages.html'>Kyiv Mass Shooting Kills 6 and Gunman Is Shot Dead After Taking Hostages in Grocery</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3350599/kyiv-gunman-kills-5-and-takes-hostages-being-shot-dead-ukraine-police'>Kyiv gunman kills 6 and takes hostages before being shot dead by Ukraine pol